### --------------------------------------------------------
### Guard Verification — test security rejection
### Use these to verify guards reject invalid requests
### --------------------------------------------------------

### Missing X-Security header (should return 401)
GET {{$dotenv HOST}}/apps
X-App-Name: {{$dotenv ADMIN_APP_NAME}}
X-Operator-Key: {{$dotenv OPERATOR_KEY}}

### Wrong X-Security key (should return 401)
GET {{$dotenv HOST}}/apps
X-Security: wrong-key
X-App-Name: {{$dotenv ADMIN_APP_NAME}}
X-Operator-Key: {{$dotenv OPERATOR_KEY}}

### Unregistered app name (should return 403)
GET {{$dotenv HOST}}/apps
X-Security: {{$dotenv SECURITY_KEY}}
X-App-Name: nonexistent-app
X-Operator-Key: {{$dotenv OPERATOR_KEY}}

### Missing X-Operator-Key on operator endpoint (should return 403)
GET {{$dotenv HOST}}/apps
X-Security: {{$dotenv SECURITY_KEY}}
X-App-Name: {{$dotenv ADMIN_APP_NAME}}

### Wrong X-Operator-Key (should return 403)
GET {{$dotenv HOST}}/apps
X-Security: {{$dotenv SECURITY_KEY}}
X-App-Name: {{$dotenv ADMIN_APP_NAME}}
X-Operator-Key: wrong-key

### Non-admin app trying operator endpoint (should return 403)
GET {{$dotenv HOST}}/apps
X-Security: {{$dotenv SECURITY_KEY}}
X-App-Name: myapp
X-Operator-Key: {{$dotenv OPERATOR_KEY}}
